# Copy to .privacy-denylist (gitignored) and add one entry per line: your name, email
# addresses, employer, home city, deployment hostname, account nicknames, etc.
# The hooks refuse any commit whose staged changes, file paths or message match.
#
# Entries are case-insensitive extended regular expressions. Escape regex characters
# in literal text: write  jane\.doe\+tag@example\.com  and  \(555\) 123-4567.
# Use \b for whole words:  \bjane\b
# Lines starting with # are ignored.
